# Robo Foreman plugin quality

When editing this plugin:

1. Keep `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json` name as `robo-foreman` (kebab-case).
2. Skills/commands/agents need YAML frontmatter with `name` + `description`.
3. Prefer deterministic work in `scripts/` with vitest coverage.
4. `/scan` reports must never invent letter grades or `/100` scores.
5. Never teach users to put Foreman paths in a shared `.gitignore` for OSS — use `.git/info/exclude`.
